return ['domain'=>'zinn-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-chat','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-30T07:02:18+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-30T07:02:18+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat','A complete help desk and AI assistant that runs on your own WordPress: an AI that answers from your own pages with links, live chat, and support tickets in wp-admin, on a submit-a-ticket page and in the WooCommerce account area. Under 10 KB on the page and no requests at all until a visitor opens it.'=>'Huduma kamili ya msaada na msaidizi wa AI anayefanya kazi kwenye WordPress yako mwenyewe: AI inayojibu kutoka kwa kurasa zako mwenyewe na viungo, gumzo la moja kwa moja, na tikiti za usaidizi katika wp-admin, kwenye ukurasa wa kuwasilisha tikiti na katika eneo la akaunti ya WooCommerce. Chini ya KB 10 kwenye ukurasa na hakuna maombi kabisa hadi mgeni atakapoufungua.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Inbox'=>'Kikasha','Tickets'=>'Tiketi','Assistant'=>'Msaidizi','Settings'=>'Mipangilio','Setup'=>'Sanidi','Zinn® Chat could not create its database tables:'=>'Zinn® Chat haikuweza kuunda majedwali yake ya hifadhidata:','The AI assistant could not answer a visitor:'=>'Msaidizi wa AI hakuweza kumjibu mgeni:','Fix it'=>'Rekebisha','Loading…'=>'Inapakia…','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Skrini hii inahitaji JavaScript.','Chat'=>'Mazungumzo','AI assistant'=>'Msaidizi wa AI','Tickets and email'=>'Tiketi na barua pepe','Site index'=>'Kielezo cha tovuti','Privacy and spam'=>'Faragha na taka taka','Connect to Zinn Digital®'=>'Unganisha na Zinn Digital®','Show the chat on the site'=>'Onyesha gumzo kwenye tovuti','Nothing appears on the site, and nothing is loaded, until this is ticked.'=>'Hakuna kinachoonekana kwenye tovuti, na hakuna kinachopakiwa, hadi hili litakapotiwa alama.','Chat title'=>'Kichwa cha mazungumzo','Greeting'=>'Salamu','The first thing a visitor sees.'=>'Jambo la kwanza ambalo mgeni huliona.','Greeting when nobody can answer'=>'Salamu wakati hakuna mtu anayeweza kujibu','Colour'=>'Rangi','Text colour on the colour'=>'Rangi ya maandishi kwenye rangi','Position'=>'Nafasi','Bottom, end side (right in left-to-right languages)'=>'Chini, upande wa mwisho (kulia katika lugha zinazoandikwa kutoka kushoto kwenda kulia)','Bottom, start side'=>'Chini, upande wa kuanzia','Offer "Talk to a person"'=>'Toa ofa ya "Ongea na mtu"','Shown while somebody has the Inbox open and is not set to away.'=>'Inaonyeshwa wakati mtu ana Kikasha kikiwa wazi na hajaweka hali ya kutokuwepo.','Hide the chat from your support team while they are signed in'=>'Ficha mazungumzo kutoka kwa timu yako ya usaidizi wakiwa wameingia kwenye akaunti yao','Show "Powered by Zinn® Chat" under the chat'=>'Onyesha "Powered by Zinn® Chat" chini ya soga','Optional. Off unless you turn it on.'=>'Si lazima. Imekatwa isipokuwa ukiwasha.','Let the AI assistant answer visitors'=>'Wacha msaidizi wa AI ajibu wageni','Assistant name'=>'Jina la msaidizi','Extra instructions for the assistant'=>'Maagizo ya ziada kwa ajili ya msaidizi','For example: "Always mention our 30-day returns." They cannot override the safety rules.'=>'Kwa mfano: "Daima taja kurejesha bidhaa zetu ndani ya siku 30." Hawezi kubatilisha sheria za usalama.','Answer language'=>'Lugha ya jibu','"auto" answers in the visitor\'s own language; or a locale such as en_GB or de_DE to always answer in one language.'=>'Majibu ya "auto" katika lugha ya mgeni mwenyewe; au eneo kama en_GB au de_DE ili kujibu kila wakati katika lugha moja.','Minimum relevance'=>'Uwiano wa chini kabisa','Passages scoring below this (0 to 0.95) are not used, and the assistant says it does not know. Check scores in the test console.'=>'Vifungu vinavyopata alama chini ya hii (0 hadi 0.95) havitumiki, na msaidizi husema hajui. Angalia alama katika konsole ya majaribio.','Offer a person after this many unanswered questions'=>'Mtolee mtu baada ya maswali haya mengi ambayo hayajajibiwa','Longest answer (tokens)'=>'Jibu linalofaa zaidi (ishara)','Accept support tickets'=>'Kubali tiketi za usaidizi','Support page'=>'Kurasa ya usaidizi','The page with the [zinn_chat_support] shortcode or the Support page block. Ticket links in emails open this page.'=>'Ukurasa ulio na nambari fupi ya [zinn_chat_support] au kizuizi cha ukurasa wa Usaidizi. Viungo vya tikiti katika barua pepe hufungua ukurasa huu.','Send team alerts to'=>'Tuma arifa za timu kwa','One or more email addresses, separated by commas. Empty: the site admin email.'=>'Barua pepe moja au zaidi, zilizotenganishwa kwa koma. Tupu: barua pepe ya msimamizi wa tovuti.','Sender name on emails'=>'Jina la mtumaji kwenye barua pepe','Email the team when a visitor waits for a person longer than (minutes)'=>'Tuma barua pepe kwa timu pale ambapo mgeni anamsubiri mtu kwa zaidi ya (dakika)','Private ticket links work for (days after the last message)'=>'Viungo vya tiketi za faragha hufanya kazi kwa (siku baada ya ujumbe wa mwisho)','After that the page offers to email a new link.'=>'Baada ya hapo ukurasa huo unatoa chaguo la kutuma kiungo kipya kupitia barua pepe.','Add a Support tab to the WooCommerce account area'=>'Ongeza kichupo cha Usaidizi kwenye eneo la akaunti ya WooCommerce','Let the assistant tell signed-in customers about their own orders'=>'Ruhusu msaidizi kuwaambia wateja walioingia kwenye akaunti zao kuhusu maagizo yao','Answers "where is my order?" from the order status and tracking.'=>'Inajibu swali "iko wapi agizo langu?" kutoka kwa hali ya agizo na ufuatiliaji.','Content the assistant reads'=>'Maudhui ambayo msaidizi anayasoma','None ticked means every public type.'=>'Hakuna iliyoteuliwa inamaanisha kila aina ya umma.','WooCommerce products, prices, stock, shipping and payment methods'=>'Bidhaa, bei, hesabu, usafirishaji na njia za malipo za WooCommerce','Forums (bbPress, BuddyBoss, wpForo)'=>'Majukwaa (bbPress, BuddyBoss, wpForo)','Read pages as visitors see them when a page builder\'s content cannot be read directly'=>'Soma kurasa kama wageni wanavyoziona wakati maudhui ya kigeuza kurasa hayawezi kusomwa moja kwa moja','Fetches the page from your own site in the background.'=>'Inaleta ukurasa kutoka kwenye tovuti yako mwenyewe kwa nyuma.','Never read these posts or pages (IDs)'=>'Kamwe usisome machapisho haya au kurasa hizi (vitambulisho)','Comma-separated.'=>'Imetenganishwa kwa koma.','Ask visitors to agree before a chat or ticket'=>'Waombe wageni wakubali kabla ya kuanzisha gumzo au tiketi','Agreement text'=>'Maandishi ya makubaliano','Privacy policy link'=>'Kiungo cha sera ya faragha','Empty: the site\'s privacy policy page.'=>'Tupu: ukurasa wa sera ya faragha ya tovuti.','Delete finished chats and tickets after (days)'=>'Futa mazungumzo na tiketi zilizomalizika baada ya (siku)','0 keeps them.'=>'0 inazihifadhi.','Store visitors\' IP addresses'=>'Hifadhi anwani za IP za wageni','Off: only a coded form is kept, enough for spam limits.'=>'Imezimwa: fumbo lililosimbwa pekee ndilo linalohifadhiwa, linalotosha kwa vikomo vya barua taka.','Messages per visitor per hour'=>'Ujumbe kwa kila mgeni kwa saa','Chats per visitor per day'=>'Mazungumzo kwa kila mgeni kwa siku','Tickets per visitor per day'=>'Tiketi kwa kila mgeni kwa siku','Longest chat message (characters)'=>'Ujumbe mrefu zaidi wa mazungumzo (idadi ya herufi)','Block list'=>'Orodha ya kuzuia','One per line: an IP address, an email address, @domain.com, or a word.'=>'Moja kwa mstari: anwani ya IP, anwani ya barua pepe, @domain.com, au neno.','Where chats are answered'=>'Mahali ambapo mazungumzo yanajibiwa','"This site" keeps everything in this site\'s database and uses your own AI key. "Zinn Digital®" uses the hosted inbox in the Zinn® app (for Zinn® hosting customers).'=>'"Tovuti hii" huweka kila kitu kwenye hifadhidata ya tovuti hii na hutumia ufunguo wako mwenyewe wa AI. "Zinn Digital®" hutumia kikasha kilichopangishwa kwenye programu ya Zinn® (kwa wateja wa upangishaji wa Zinn®).','This site (recommended)'=>'Tovuti hii (inayopendekezwa)','Zinn Digital® app'=>'Programu ya Zinn Digital®','Zinn® widget key'=>'Ufunguo wa wijeti ya Zinn®','From the Zinn® app: Live chat, then your widget. Starts with zc_.'=>'Kutoka kwa programu ya Zinn®: Gumzo la moja kwa moja, kisha wijeti yako. Huanza na zc_.','Zinn® Chat settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Zinn® Chat','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','The assistant uses your own AI key.'=>'Msaidizi anatumia ufunguo wako wa AI.','AI providers and models'=>'Watoa huduma na mifano ya AI','— None —'=>'— Hakuna —','Saved — leave empty to keep'=>'Imehifadhiwa — acha wazi ili kubaki','Remove the saved key'=>'Ondoa ufunguo uliOhifadhiwa','You are not allowed to change these settings.'=>'Huruhusiwi kubadilisha mipangilio hii.','Turn the chat on'=>'Washa gumzo','The chat is showing on your site.'=>'Mazungumzo yanaonekana kwenye tovuti yako.','Nothing is shown or loaded on your site until you turn it on.'=>'Hakuna kinachoonyeshwa au kupakiwa kwenye tovuti yako hadi utakapoiwasha.','Turn off'=>'Zima','Turn on'=>'Washa','Connect your AI provider'=>'Unganisha mtoa huduma wako wa AI','Connected. Site search uses %1$s (%2$s).'=>'Imeunganishwa. Utafutaji wa tovuti unatumia %1$s (%2$s).','Connected. Your provider cannot build a meaning-based index, so the assistant uses keyword search. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key for better answers.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Mtoa huduma wako hawezi kujenga fahirisi inayotegemea maana, kwa hivyo msaidizi anatumia utafutaji wa maneno muhimu. Ongeza ufunguo wa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral au OpenRouter kwa majibu bora zaidi.','Add a key for Google Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Mistral, OpenRouter or any OpenAI-compatible service. The newest model is chosen for you; you can change it.'=>'Ongeza ufunguo wa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Mistral, OpenRouter au huduma yoyote inayooana na OpenAI. Mfano mpya zaidi unachaguliwa kwa ajili yako; unaweza kuubadilisha.','AI providers'=>'Watoa huduma za AI','Let the assistant read your site'=>'Ruhusu msaidizi asome tovuti yako','%1$d pages read, %2$d waiting, %3$d passages. New and edited content is picked up automatically.'=>'Kurasa %1$d zimesomwa, %2$d zinasubiri, vifungu %3$d. Maudhui mapya na yaliyohaririwa huchukuliwa kiotomatiki.','Read the whole site now'=>'Soma tovuti yote sasa','Create your support page'=>'Undaa ukurasa wako wa usaidizi','Visitors submit tickets there, and ticket emails link to it.'=>'Wagenzi huwasilisha tiketi huko, na barua pepe za tiketi huunganisha kwenye ukurasa huo.','A page with the ticket form, where customers also follow their requests.'=>'Ukurasa wenye fomu ya tikiti, ambapo wateja pia hufuatilia maombi yao.','View'=>'Tazama','Create the support page'=>'Undaa ukurasa wa usaidizi','Add "Submit a ticket" and "Chat with us" to a menu'=>'Ongeza "Wasilisha tikiti" na "Piga gumzo nasi" kwenye menyu','Appearance, Menus: use the Zinn® Chat box. Or add the Zinn® Chat blocks to any page, in any page builder.'=>'Mwonekano, Menyu: tumia kisanduku cha Zinn® Chat. Au ongeza vizuizi vya Zinn® Chat kwenye ukurasa wowote, katika kichenzi chochote cha ukurasa.','Menus'=>'Menyu','WooCommerce account area'=>'Eneo la akaunti ya WooCommerce','Customers see their tickets under Support in My Account, and the assistant can tell them where their order is.'=>'Wateja huona tikiti zao chini ya Sehemu ya Msaada katika Akaunti Yangu, na msaidizi anaweza kuwaambia agizo lao liko wapi.','Test the assistant'=>'Jaribu msaidizi','Ask it questions and see exactly which pages it answered from, including out-of-date ones.'=>'Uliza maswali na uone ni kurasa zipi hasa ilizojibu, ikiwemo zile zilizopitwa na wakati.','Open the test console'=>'Fungua kiweko cha majaribio','Answer live chats'=>'Jibu mazungumzo ya moja kwa moja','Visitors can ask for a person while you have the Inbox open. It works on a phone too.'=>'Wagenzi wanaweza kuuliza mtu mwingine wakati una Sanduku la Kuingia likiwa wazi. Inafanya kazi kwenye simu pia.','Open the Inbox'=>'Fungua Kikasha','Set up Zinn® Chat'=>'Sanidi Zinn® Chat','This site is connected to the Zinn Digital® app: chats are answered there. To run the help desk on this site instead, choose "This site" under Settings, Connect to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Tovuti hii imeunganishwa na programu ya Zinn Digital®: mazungumzo yanajibiwa huko. Ili kuendesha dawati la usaidizi kwenye tovuti hii badala yake, chagua "Tovuti hii" chini ya Mipungilio, Unganisha na Zinn Digital®.','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'Huruhusu kufanya hivyo.','Unlimited agents, with a Support agent role that sees only chats and tickets'=>'Mawakala wasio na kikomo, wenye jukumu la wakala wa Usaidizi anayeweza kuona gumzo na tikiti pekee','Reply to tickets by email'=>'Jibu tikiti kwa barua pepe','Knowledge base: articles, categories, search, and a KB section in the chat'=>'Msingi wa maarifa: makala, kategoria, utafutaji, na sehemu ya KB kwenye gumzo','Saved replies, business hours, priorities and SLAs'=>'Majibu yaliyohifadhiwa, saa za kazi, vipaumbele na SLA','Suggested replies, thread summaries and auto-tagging by AI'=>'Majibu yaliyopendekezwa, muhtasari wa nyuzi na uwekaji lebo otomatiki unaofanywa na AI','Knowledge-gap report: the questions your site could not answer'=>'Ripoti ya pengo la maarifa: maswali ambayo tovuti yako haikuweza kuyajibu','Push notifications and an installable agent app for your phone'=>'Arifa za kushinikiza na programu ya wakala inayoweza kusakinishwa kwenye simu yako','Proactive messages, reports, webhooks, Slack and Telegram alerts'=>'Ujumbe tendaji, ripoti, webhook, na arifa za Slack na Telegram','Zinn® Chat Pro'=>'Zinn® Chat Pro','From $%1$d a month or $%2$d a year for one site.'=>'Kuanzia $%1$d kwa mwezi au $%2$d kwa mwaka kwa tovuti moja.','Try Pro free for 14 days'=>'Jaribu Pro bure kwa siku 14','See plans'=>'Tazama mipango','No card needed for the trial.'=>'Hakuna kadi inayohitajika kwa jaribio.','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Watengenezaji wa ChatGPT. Msaidizi mzuri wa pande zote.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Watengenezaji wa Claude. Wana nguvu katika uandishi na hoja makini.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Miundo ya Gemini ya Google. Haraka na ya bei nafuu.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Kampuni ya Uropa ya AI yenye miundo ya haraka na ya bei nafuu.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Miundo ya bei ya chini ambayo ni nzuri katika uandishi na msimbo.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Ufunguo mmoja kwa mif modelos kutoka watoa huduma wengi tofauti.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Huduma yoyote inayofanya kazi kama API ya OpenAI, ikiwa ni pamoja na mtindo unaoendesha kwenye kompyuta au seva yako mwenyewe.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Kwa ujumla (hutumika wakati hakuna maalum zaidi iliyowekwa)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kuandika na kuandika upya','Translation'=>'Tafsiri','Code and CSS'=>'Msimbo na CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Samahani, huruhusiwi kufikia ukurasa huu.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Mipangilio hii inashirikiwa na kila programu-jalizi inayozitumia: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Funguo zako zimesimbwa kwa njia fiche katika hifadhidata ya tovuti hii na hutumwa tu kwa mtoa huduma uliyemchagua — kamwe hazipelekwi kwetu.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Hatua ya 1 kati ya 2: chagua mtoa huduma wa AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Unaleta ufunguo wako mwenyewe, kwa hiyo unamlipa mtoaji huduma moja kwa moja kwa kile unachotumia. Huna uhakika? Yoyote kati ya hizi inafanya kazi vizuri; unaweza kuongeza nyingine baadaye.','Next'=>'Wafuatao','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Hatua ya 2 kati ya 2: unganisha %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako inayooana na OpenAI, inayomalizika kwa /v1. Ufunguo unahitajika tu ikiwa huduma inaomba mmoja.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Fungua %s na uingie (au ufungue akaunti ya bure).','the %s API keys page'=>'ukurasa wa funguo za API za %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Unda ufunguo mpya na uunakili.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Bandika hapa chini kisha ubonyeze "Hifadhi na ujaribu". Tunatuma ombi moja dogo ili kuangalia kama inafanya kazi.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Watoa huduma wengi wanahitaji mkopo kidogo kwenye akaunti kabla ya ufunguo kufanya kazi: %s.','add credit'=>'ongeza mkopo','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Chagua mtoa huduma mwingine','Address'=>'Anwani','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Ufunguo uliohifadhiwa unaishia kwenye …%s — bandika mpya ili kuubadilisha','Key (optional)'=>'Ufunguo (si lazima)','API key'=>'Ufunguo wa API','Save and test'=>'Hifadhi na jaribu','Providers'=>'Watoaji','Provider'=>'Mtoa huduma','Status'=>'Hali','Key'=>'Ufunguo','Get a key'=>'Pata ufunguo','Test'=>'Jaribu','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Imesifadhiwa na toleo jipya zaidi la programu jalizi: sasisha programu jalizi hii, au uweke ufunguo tena.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ufunguo uliohifadhiwa hauwezi kufunguliwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zimebadilika). Iweke tena.','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Imeunganishwa — jaribio la mwisho limefaulu %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Jaribio la mwisho limeshindwa: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Imeunganishwa — haijajaribiwa bado','Which model to use'=>'Ni mfano gani wa kutumia','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ inaashiria pendekezo letu kwa ajili ya kazi hiyo. Orodha hiyo inajumuisha kila modeli ambayo ufunguo wako unaweza kutumia, ikisomwa moja kwa moja kutoka kwa mtoa huduma.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Inapendekezwa kwa mtoa huduma —','Save models'=>'Hifadhi miundo','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sasisha orodha za mi modelos kutoka kwa watoa huduma','Images'=>'Picha','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Unganisha OpenAI au Google Gemini ili kutengeneza picha.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Mfano mpya zaidi wa picha wa mtoa huduma wa kwanza aliyeunganishwa —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Utafutaji wa tovuti (embeddings)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Unganisha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral au OpenRouter ili uunde faharasa ya utafutaji ya tovuti yako.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Mfano mpya zaidi wa kuweka wa mtoa huduma wa kwanza aliyeunganishwa —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Kubadilisha hiki kunaunda upya faharasa ya utafutaji ya kila programu-jalizi inayokitumia.','best quality'=>'ubora bora zaidi','lowest cost'=>'gharama ya chini kabisa','fastest'=>'haraka zaidi','Add a model yourself'=>'Ongeza mfano mwenyewe','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Modeli imetoka leo? Bandika jina lake kamili ili uitumie mara moja.','Model name'=>'Jina la mfano','Add model'=>'Ongeza modeli','Recommended models list'=>'Orodha ya miundo inayopendekezwa','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Orodha ya miundo inayopendekezwa haikuweza kuthibitishwa, kwa hiyo hakuna mapendekezo yanayoonyeshwa. Sakinisha tena programu-jalizi, au uwashe masasisho ya kila siku hapa chini.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Orodha inayotumika ilichapishwa mnamo %s. Kila sasisho la programu-jalizi huleta mpya.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Pia kagua Zinn Digital® mara moja kwa siku kwa orodha iliyosasishwa.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ombi la upakuaji wazi pekee ndinalotum和小: hakuna ufunguo, hakuna anwani ya tovuti, hakuna chochote kuhusu maudhui yako. Orodha hiyo imesainiwa, na orodha ambayo inashindwa ukaguzi wa sahihi inapuzwa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Mara ya mwisho kukaguliwa %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Hifadhi, na uangalie sasa ikiwa imewashwa','a newer list was installed'=>'orododha mpya zaidi imewekwa','already up to date'=>'tayari imesasishwa','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'upakuaji umeshindwa ukaguzi wa sahihi na umepuuzwa','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuwezi kufikiwa; orodha ya sasa inaendelea kutumika','turned off'=>'imezimwa','Open'=>'Fungua','Check their status page'=>'Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali','Open your billing page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa malipo','Open your API keys page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa funguo za API','Open the AI settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio ya AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Samahani, huruhusiwi kufanya hivyo.','Unknown provider.'=>'Mtoa huduma hajulikani.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako, kwa mfano http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Hiyo haionekani kama ufunguo wa API. Nakili tena, bila nafasi.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Bandika ufunguo wako wa API kwanza.','Key removed.'=>'Ufunguo umeondolewa.','Models saved.'=>'Mifumo imehifadhiwa.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Weka jina halisi la mfano, kwa mfano kama nyaraka za mtoa huduma zinavyoandika.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'Imeongezwa %s. Ichague chini ya "Which model to use".','Model removed.'=>'Kielelezo kimeondolewa.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Sasisho za kila siku zimezimwa. Orodha iliyokuja na programu-jalizi inatumika.','Checked: %s.'=>'Imetezwa: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Orodha za miundo zimesasishwa.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI umehifadhiwa na toleo jipya zaidi la moja ya programu-jalizi zako. Sasisha programu-jalizi hii, au weka ufunguo tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako uliohifadhiwa wa AI hauwezi kufunguliwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zimebadilika). Ingiza tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI haijasidiwa bado. Ongeza ufunguo wa mtoa huduma wa AI katika mipangilio ya AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mfano uliochaguliwa kwa kazi hii. Chagua mmoja katika mipangilio ya AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyo wa AI hautumiki na toleo hili la programu-jalizi.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mtoa huduma wa AI anayeweza kuunda picha ambaye ameunganishwa. Ongeza ufunguo wa OpenAI au Google Gemini katika mipangilio ya AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyu wa AI hawezi kutengeneza picha. Chagua OpenAI au Google Gemini kwa ajili ya picha katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI hauwezi kutumia mtindo wowote wa picha. Angalia ruhusa za ufunguo huo kwa mtoa huduma, au chagua mtoa huduma mwingine kwa ajili ya picha.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mtoa huduma wa AI aliyeunganishwa anayeweza kuunda faharasa ya utafutaji. Ongeza ufunguo wa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral au OpenRouter katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI hauwezi kutumia mtindo wowote wa upachikaji. Angalia ruhusa za ufunguo huo na mtoa huduma, au chagua mtoa huduma mwingine kwa ajili ya utafutaji wa tovuti.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyu wa AI hawezi kujenga faharasa ya utafutaji. Unganisha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral au huduma inayooana kwa ajili ya utafutaji wa tovuti.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia huduma yako ya AI. Hakikisha kuwa inafanya kazi na kwamba anwani yake inaweza kufikiwa kutoka kwa seva yako ya mtandao (huduma iliyo kwenye kompyuta yako mwenyewe haiwezi kufikiwa kutoka kwa tovuti inayopangishwa).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia %s. Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali; ikiwa wako hewani, mwenyeji wako anaweza kuwa anazuia miunganisho ya kutoa, au anwani si sahihi.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s inasema akaunti yako haina salio au kiasi kilichobaki. Ongeza salio au ongeza kikomo chako kwenye akaunti yako nao, kisha jaribu tena.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s haikukubali ufunguo wako. Huenda umechapishwa vibaya, umebatilishwa au umekwisha muda wake. Unda ufunguo mpya na ubandike hapa.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s imekataa ombi hili kwa ufunguo wako. Ufunguo huenda hauna ufikiaji wa mtindo au kipengele hiki, atau akaunti yako inahitaji uthibitishaji.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Modeli "%1$s" haipatikani kutoka kwa %2$s kwa ajili ya ufunguo wako. Chagua modeli nyingine katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Mpango wako wa %2$s haujumuishi mfano "%1$s". Chagua mfano mwingine katika mipangilio ya AI, au boresha mpango wako nao.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s inazuza kasi ya ufunguo wako kutuma maombi. Subiri dakika moja kisha ujaribu tena, au ongeza kiwango chako cha kikomo nao.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s inapata shida kwa sasa (kukatika kwa mtandao au mzigo mkubwa upande wao). Hakuna tatizo na mipangilio yako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ombi la AI limeshindwa kwa sababu ambayo hatukuweza kuitambua. Jaribu tena; ikiwa litaendelea kutokea, wasiliana na huduma kwa wateja ukitumia maelezo yaliyo hapa chini.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI amejibu kwa mfumo ambao programu-jalishi hii haikuweza kuusoma. Jaribu tena; ikiwa itaendelea kutokea, chagua mtindo mwingine au uwasiliane na usaidizi.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Maalum (Inayooana na OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Hifadhi kitufe cha mtoa huduma huyu kwanza.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Ufunguo wako unafanya kazi, lakini mtoa huduma hajaorodhesha mtindo wowote wa maandishi kwa ajili yake. Ongeza mtindo wewe mwenyewe hapa chini.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Imeunganishwa. %1$s amejibu kwa kutumia %2$s. Vipengele vyako vya AI viko tayari kutumika.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Jukumu lako la mtumiaji haliruhusiwi kutumia AI kwenye tovuti hii. Muombe msimamizi.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha matumizi ya AI ya kila mwezi. Msimamizi anaweza kukiinua katika mipangilio ya AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha kila mwezi cha maombi ya AI. Msimamizi anaweza kukiongeza katika mipangilio ya AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Matumizi na gharama','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Kumbukumbu, mipaka na ruhusa za nafasi zinatumika kwa AI inayotumiwa kupitia: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Gharama ni za makadirio, zilizokokotwo kutokana na bei zilizochapishwa; modeli isiyo na bei inayojulikana inahesabiwa kuwa sifuri.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Mwezi huu: maombi %1$s, takriban %2$s.','When'=>'Wakati','Who'=>'Nani','Used for'=>'Inayotumika kwa','Model'=>'Mtindo','Tokens in / out'=>'Tokeni zinazotoka / zinazoingia','About'=>'Kuhusu','Result'=>'Matokeo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Hakuna maombi ya AI yaliyofanywa bado.','Done'=>'Imekamilika','Limits and permissions'=>'Vikomo na ruhusa','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Kikomo cha matumizi ya kila mwezi (dola za US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Acha wazi kukiwa hakuna kikomo. AI husimama kwa mwezi uliobaki mara tu gharama inayokadiriwa inapofikia kiwango hicho.','Monthly request limit'=>'Kikomo cha maombi ya kila mwezi','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Acha wazi bila kikomo.','Who may use AI'=>'Nani anayeweza kutumia AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Usitie alama yoyote ili kumruhusu kila mtu anayeweza kutumia vipengele vya programu-jalizi kutumia AI. Wasimamizi wanaweza kuitumia kila wakati.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Hifadhi vizuizi na ruhusa','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Vizuizi na ruhusa vimehifadhiwa.','Content'=>'Maudhui','Not found.'=>'Haijapatikana.','%s joined the chat.'=>'%s amejiunga na mazungumzo.','Type a reply first.'=>'Andika jibu kwanza.','The chat has ended. Thank you for contacting us.'=>'Mazungumzo yamekwisha. Asante kwa kuwasiliana nasi.','You are chatting with the assistant again.'=>'Unazungumza na msaidizi tena.','This conversation is now ticket #%d. We will reply by email.'=>'Mazungumzo haya sasa ni tikiti #%d. Tutajibu kwa barua pepe.','Type a question first.'=>'Andika swali kwanza.','The whole site is being read again in the background.'=>'Tovuti nzima inasomwa tena kwa nyuma.','Meanings are being rebuilt in the background.'=>'Maana zinajengwa upya chinichini.','Submit a ticket form'=>'Wasilisha fomu ya tikiti','Heading'=>'Kichwa cha habari','Default subject'=>'Kichwa-habari chaguo-lagu','Button text'=>'Maandishi ya kitufe','Show the subject field (yes or no)'=>'Onyesha sehemu ya somo (ndiyo au hapana)','My support requests'=>'Maombi yangu ya usaidizi','Chat button'=>'Kitufe cha mazungumzo','Chat with us'=>'Ongea nasi','Support'=>'Usaidizi','Thank you. Your request is ticket #%d. We have emailed you a link to follow it.'=>'Asante. Ombi lako ni tikiti #%d. Tumekutumia barua pepe yenye kiungo cha kulifuatilia.','Your reply has been sent.'=>'Jibu lako limetumwa.','If there is a request under that address, we have emailed you a new link.'=>'Ikiwa kuna ombi chini ya anwani hiyo, tumekutumia kiungo kipya kupitia barua pepe.','Something went wrong. Please check the form and try again.'=>'Kulikuwa na tatizo. Tafadhali angalia fomu na ujaribu tena.','Your message could not be sent.'=>'Ujumbe wako haukuweza kutumwa.','You are sending messages too quickly. Please wait a little and try again.'=>'Unatuma ujumbe haraka sana. Tafadhali subiri kidogo kisha ujaribu tena.','Please agree to the privacy notice to send your request.'=>'Tafadhali kubali taarifa ya faragha ili kutuma ombi lako.','Please complete the check to show you are not a robot.'=>'Tafadhali kamilisha ukaguzi ili kuonyesha wewe si roboti.','Sign in to see your support requests.'=>'Ingia ili uone maombi yako ya usaidizi.','Your name'=>'Jina lako','Your email'=>'Barua pepe yako','Subject'=>'Mada','Which order is this about?'=>'Agizo gani hili?','Not about an order'=>'Si kuhusu agizo','How can we help?'=>'Tunawezaje kusaidia?','Privacy policy'=>'Sera ya faragha','Send request'=>'Tuma ombi','All requests'=>'Maombi yote','Your support requests'=>'Maombi yako ya usaidizi','You have no support requests yet.'=>'Huna maombi ya usaidizi bado.','Updated'=>'Imesasishwa','New request'=>'Ombi jipya','This link has expired. Enter your email address and we will send you a new one.'=>'Kiungo hiki kimepitwa na wakati. Weka anwani yako ya barua pepe na tutakutumia mpya.','This link is not valid. Enter your email address and we will send you a link to your requests.'=>'Kiungo hiki si sahihi. Weka anwani yako ya barua pepe na tutakutumia kiungo cha maombi yako.','Email me a new link'=>'Nitumie kiungo kipya kupitia barua pepe','Request #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Ombi #%1$d: %2$s','Status:'=>'Hali:','Your reply'=>'Jibu lako','Send reply'=>'Tuma jibu','You'=>'Wewe','Submit a ticket'=>'Wasilisha tikiti','Add to Menu'=>'Ongeza kwenye Menyu','Create the support page on the Zinn® Chat setup screen to add a "Submit a ticket" link.'=>'Unda ukurasa wa usaidizi kwenye skrini ya kusanidi ya Zinn® Chat ili kuongeza kiungo cha "Wasilisha tikiti".','[#%1$d] We have your request: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Tumepokea ombi lako: %2$s','Thank you for contacting us. We have received your request and will reply as soon as we can.'=>'Asante kwa kuwasiliana nasi. Tumepokea ombi lako na tutakujibu haraka iwezekanavyo.','View your request'=>'Tazama ombi lako','[#%1$d] New ticket: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Tiketi mpya: %2$s','Open the ticket'=>'Fungua tikiti','[#%1$d] New reply: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Jibu jipya: %2$s','You can reply on the page below.'=>'Unaweza kujibu kwenye ukurasa ulio hapa chini.','View and reply'=>'Tazama na ujibu','[#%1$d] Customer replied: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Mteja amejibu: %2$s','A visitor is waiting in chat #%d'=>'Mgeni anasubiri kwenye soga #%d','A visitor asked to talk to a person and is waiting for an answer.'=>'Mgeni ameomba kuongea na mtu na anasubiri jibu.','Answer now'=>'Jibu sasa','Your chat with %s'=>'Mazungumzo yako na %s','[#%d] Your link to your request'=>'[#%d] Kiungo chako cha ombi lako','Here is a new link to your request. The old one no longer works.'=>'Hapa kuna kiungo kipya cha ombi lako. Cha zamani hakifanyi kazi tena.','From: %s'=>'Kutoka kwa: %s','a visitor'=>'mgeni','Zinn® Chat chats and support tickets'=>'Mazungumzo na tiketi za usaidizi za Zinn® Chat','Chats'=>'Mazungumzo','Started'=>'Imeanza','Name'=>'Jina','Email'=>'Barua pepe','Page'=>'Ukurasa','Messages'=>'Ujumbe','Support tickets'=>'Tiketi za usaidizi','Ticket'=>'Tiketi','Opened'=>'Imefunguliwa','When you use the chat or submit a support request, we store your messages, the name and email address you give us, the page you were on and a coded form of your IP address, so that we can answer you and keep a record of your request.'=>'Unapotumia gumzo au kuwasilisha ombi la usaidizi, tunahifadhi ujumbe wako, jina na anwani ya barua pepe unayotupa, ukurasa uliokuwa na fomu iliyosimbwa ya anwani yako ya IP, ili tuweze kukujibu na kuweka rekodi ya ombi lako.','If our AI assistant answers you, your message and passages from this website are sent to the AI provider we use to produce the answer.'=>'Kama msaidizi wetu wa AI akikujibu, ujumbe wako na vifungu kutoka tovuti hii vinatumwa kwa mtoa huduma wa AI tunaemtumia ili kutoa jibu.','The chat is not available right now.'=>'Gumzo halipatikani kwa sasa.','Please type a message.'=>'Tafadhali chapa ujumbe.','Please agree to the privacy notice to start the chat.'=>'Tafadhali kubali taarifa ya faragha ili kuanza mazungumzo.','You have started too many chats today. Please try again tomorrow or send us a ticket.'=>'Umeanza gumzo nyingi sana leo. Tafadhali jaribu tena kesho au tutumie tiketi.','The chat could not be started. Please try again.'=>'Mazungumzo hayakuweza kuanzishwa. Tafadhali jaribu tena.','Nobody can answer in chat right now. Leave your email address and we will reply by email.'=>'Hakuna anayeweza kujibu kwenye soga kwa sasa. Acha barua pepe yako na tutakujibu kupitia barua pepe.','The assistant cannot answer right now. You can ask for a person or leave us a message.'=>'Msaidizi hawezi kujibu kwa sasa. Unaweza kuuliza mtu au kutuachia ujumbe.','We are putting you through to a person. Please stay on this page.'=>'Tunakuunganisha na mtu mwingine. Tafadhali baki kwenye ukurasa huu.','This chat has ended.'=>'Mazungumzo haya yamemalizika.','Tickets are not available right now.'=>'Tiketi hazipatikani kwa sasa.','Visitor'=>'Mgeni','Team'=>'Timu','Chat so far:'=>'Mazungumzo kufikia sasa:','Thank you. Your request is ticket #%d and we will reply by email.'=>'Asante. Ombi lako ni tikiti #%d na tutajibu kupitia barua pepe.','Please enter a valid email address.'=>'Tafadhali ingiza anwani halali ya barua pepe.','This link is not valid.'=>'Kiungo hiki si halali.','This link has expired. We can email you a new one.'=>'Kiungo hiki kimepitwa na wakati. Tunaweza kukutumia kiungo kipya kupitia barua pepe.','You cannot see this ticket.'=>'Huwezi kuona tikiti hili.','Hi! Ask me anything about this site. I answer from its own pages, and I can put you through to a person.'=>'Hujambo! Niulize chochote kuhusu tovuti hii. Ninajibu kutoka kwa kurasa zake zenyewe, na ninaweza kukuunganisha na mtu.','Hi! How can we help? Send us a message and we will get back to you.'=>'Hujambo! Tunawezaje kusaidia? Tutumie ujumbe na tutakurudia.','Nobody is online right now. Leave your question and email address and we will reply by email.'=>'Hakuna aliye mtandaoni kwa sasa. Acha swali lako na anwani yako ya barua pepe na tutakujibu kupitia barua pepe.','We keep this conversation so we can answer you.'=>'Tunaihifadhi mazungumzo haya ili tuweze kukujibu.','Please enter a valid email address so we can reply.'=>'Tafadhali weka anwani halali ya barua pepe ili tuweze kukujibu.','Please describe what you need help with.'=>'Tafadhali eleza kile unachohitaji msaada nacho.','The ticket could not be saved. Please try again.'=>'Tiketi haikuweza kuhifadhiwa. Tafadhali jaribu tena.','That ticket 