on but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Mara tu leseni yako itakapokwisha bado unaweza kutumia toleo la Bure lakini HUTAWA na ufikiaji wa vipengele vya %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Leseni yako itakapokwisha, hutaweza tena kutumia %s, isipokuwa ukiwezesha tena kwa leseni halali ya kulipia.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Bado unaweza kufurahia vipengele vyote vya %1$s lakini hutapata ufikiaji wa usalama wa %2$s na masasisho ya vipengele, wala usaidizi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Asante kwa kuboresha.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Baada ya majaribio yako ya bure ya %1$s, lipa kiasi kidogo kama %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Kubaliana & Amsha Leseni','I Agree - Change User'=>'Nakubali - Badilisha Mtumiaji','All Requests'=>'Maombi Yote','All Types'=>'Aina zote','allow'=>'ruhusu','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Umeshajisajili kwenye ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, ambao unatusaidia kuendelea kuboresha %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Tayari umejiandikisha katika ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, jambo ambalo linatusaidia kuendelea kuboresha vipengele hivyo.','Amount'=>'Kiasi','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Kila mwaka','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kila mwaka','Anonymous feedback'=>'Maoni ya siri','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti zote kwenye mtandao.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti zote zinazosubiri.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Omba kuwa mshirika','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Idhinisha na Anzisha Jaribio','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Tafadhali tuambie sababu ili tuweze kuboresha.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the