ck to the %s plan.'=>'Leseni yako imezimwa kwa mafanikio, umerudi kwenye mpango wa %s.','Your %s license was successfully deactivated.'=>'Leseni yako ya %s imezimwa kwa mafanikio.','Your license has expired. You can still continue using the free %s forever.'=>'Leseni yako imekwisha muda wake. Unaweza kuendelea kutumia %s ya bure milele.','Your license has expired. %1$sUpgrade now%2$s to continue using the %3$s without interruptions.'=>'Leseni yako imeisha muda wake. %1$sBoresha sasa%2$s ili uendelee kutumia %3$s bila kukatizwa.','Your license has expired. You can still continue using all the %s features, but you\'ll need to renew your license to continue getting updates and support.'=>'Leseni yako imeisha muda wake. Bado unaweza kuendelea kutumia vipengele vyote vya %s, lakini utahitaji kusasisha leseni yako ili uendelee kupata masasisho na usaidizi.','License ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Leseni','License issues?'=>'Je, kuna matatizo ya leseni?','Single Site License'=>'Leseni ya Tovuti Moja','Unlimited Licenses'=>'Leseni Zisizo na Kikomo','Up to %s Sites'=>'Hadi Tovuti %s','Is this your client\'s site? %s if you wish to hide sensitive info like your email, license key, prices, billing address & invoices from the WP Admin.'=>'Je, hii ni tovuti ya mteja wako? %s ikiwa ungependa kuficha maelezo nyeti kama vile barua pepe yako, ufunguo wa leseni, bei, anwani ya malipo na ankara kutoka kwa WP Admin.','Your %1$s license was flagged as white-labeled to hide sensitive information from the WP Admin (e.g. your email, license key, prices, billing address & invoices). If you ever wish to revert it back, you can easily do it through your %2$s. If this was a mistake you can also %3$s.'=>'Leseni yako ya %1$s iliwekewa alama ya kuondolewa chapa ili kuficha maelezo nyeti kutoka kwa WP Admin (k.m. barua pepe yako, ufunguo wa leseni, bei, anwani ya malipo na ankara). Ikiwa ungependa kuirudisha wakati wowote, unaweza kufanya hivyo kwa urahisi kupitia %2$s yako. Ikiwa hili lilikuwa kosa, unaw