issions on.'=>'Kwa kujiondoa kwenye kushiriki habari hii na seva ya masasisho, utalazimika kuangalia matoleo mapya ya %1$s na kuyapakua na kuyasakinisha mwenyewe. Si tu usumbufu, lakini kukosa sasisho kunaweza kuhatarisha tovuti yako na kusababisha masuala yasiyo ya lazima ya uoanifu, kwa hiyo tunapendekeza sana kuweka ruhusa hizi muhimu zikiwa zimewashwa.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Ghairi %1$s - Sihitaji tena masasisho yoyote ya usalama na vipengele, wala usaidizi wa %2$s kwa sababu sipangi kutumia %3$s kwenye tovuti hii, au tovuti nyingine yoyote.','Cancel %s?'=>'Ghairi %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Inafuta %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Inaghairi %s...','Click here'=>'Bofya hapa','Deactivating'=>'Inazima','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Kutenganisha tovuti kutauondoa kabisa %s kutoka kwa akaunti ya Dashibodi ya Mtumiaji wako.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Kwa ajili ya utoaji wa kiotomatiki wa usalama na sasisho za vipengele, na usimamizi na ulinzi wa leseni, %s inahitaji:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Kwa ajili ya utoaji wa usalama na sasisho za vipengele, na usimamizi wa leseni, %s inahitaji','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius ndiyo injini yetu ya kutoa leseni na kusasisha programu','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Ikiwa hii ni nakala ya muda mrefu, ili kudumisha sasisho za kiotomatiki na utendakazi unaolipishwa baada ya %1$s, tafadhali %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Je, %2$s ni nakala rudufu ya %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Jiunge na Mpango wa Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Jiunge na programu ya Beta','License'=>'Leseni','License 