 and some text.'=>'Jibu lililohifadhiwa linahitaji kichwa na maandishi fulani.','The sitemap could not be read.'=>'Ramani ya tovuti haikuweza kusomwa.','The page could not be read.'=>'Ukurasa haukuweza kusomwa.','Very poor'=>'Dhaifu sana','Poor'=>'Dhaifu','OK'=>'Sawa','Good'=>'Nzuri','Excellent'=>'Bora sana','[#%1$d] How did we do? %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Tumefanyaje? %2$s','We marked your request as solved. How happy are you with the help you got?'=>'Tuliashiria ombi lako kuwa limetatuliwa. Una furaha gani na msaada uliopokea?','One click is enough. If something is still wrong, just reply to your request and it opens again.'=>'Mbofyo mmoja unatosha. Ikiwa bado kuna tatizo, jibu tu ombi lako nalo litafunguka tena.','This rating link is not valid any more. Thank you all the same.'=>'Kiungo hiki cha ukadiriaji hakitumiki tena. Asante hata hivyo.','Thank you. Your comment has been passed to the team.'=>'Asante. Maoni yako yamewasilishwa kwa timu.','How happy are you with the help you got?'=>'Je, una furaha gani na msaada uliopata?','Anything you would like to tell us? (optional)'=>'Chochote ungependa kutuambia? (si lazima)','Thank you for your rating.'=>'Asante kwa ukadiriaji wako.','Back to the site'=>'Rudi kwenye tovuti','The knowledge base is switched off.'=>'Msingi wa maarifa umezimwa.','Knowledge gaps'=>'Mapengo ya maarifa','Nothing selected.'=>'Hakuna iliyochaguliwa.','%1$s We are back %2$s.'=>'%1$s Tumereje %2$s.','First reply'=>'Jibu la kwanza','Reply to this email to answer.'=>'Jibu barua pepe hii ili kujibu.','Email from %s (not the customer on this ticket):'=>'Barua pepe kutoka kwa %s (si mteja kwenye tikiti hii):','%d email read.'=>'Barua pepe %d imesomwa.' . "\0" . 'Barua pepe %d zimesomwa.','Import a knowledge base'=>'Ingiza msingi wa maarifa','Import'=>'Agiza','KB import'=>'Uingizaji wa KB','Last import: %1$d articles, %2$d categories. %3$s'=>'Uingizaji wa mwisho: makala %1$d, kategoria %2$d. %3$s','Finished.'=>'Imekamilika.','Still running in the background: reload to see progress.'=>'Bado inaendelea chinichini: pakia upya ili uone maendeleo.','Copies articles and categories from another knowledge base on this site into the Zinn® Chat knowledge base, keeping the category tree, the order, the slugs and the content. Old addresses redirect to the new ones. Running it again updates instead of duplicating.'=>'Inakili makala na kategoria kutoka kwenye msingi mwingine wa maarifa kwenye tovuti hii hadi kwenye msingi wa maarifa wa Zinn® Chat, huku ikihifadhi muundo wa kategoria, mpangilio, slug na maudhui. Anwani za zamani zinaelekezwa upya kwenye mpya. Kuiendesha tena kunasasisha badala ya kuongeza nakala.','Import from'=>'Ingiza kutoka','%1$s (%2$d articles)'=>'%1$s (%2$d makala)','Another post type:'=>'Aina nyingine ya chapisho:','with categories from'=>'zenye kategoria kutoka','(none)'=>'(hakuna)','The pages under this page:'=>'Kurasa zilizali chini ya ukurasa huu:','The originals'=>'Nakala asili','Set the imported originals to draft (their addresses then redirect to the new articles)'=>'Weka nakala asili zilizoingizwa kuwa rasimu (anuani zao kisha zinaelekezwa upya kwenye makala mpya)','You are not allowed to import.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuagiza.','yes or no'=>'ndiyo au la','Knowledge base home'=>'Ukurasa wa mwanzo wa msingi wa maarifa','Heading (empty: the KB title)'=>'Kichwa cha habari (tupu: kichwa cha KB)','Only these categories (slugs or IDs, comma-separated)'=>'Kategori hizi pekee (slugs au vitambulisho, zilizotengwa kwa koma)','Leave out these categories'=>'Ondoa kategoria hizi','Columns, 1 to 4'=>'Safu, 1 hadi 4','Articles under each category (0 for none)'=>'Makala chini ya kila kategoria (0 kama hakuna)','Show article counts (%s)'=>'Onyesha idadi ya makala (%s)','Show the search box (%s)'=>'Onyesha kisanduku cha utafutaji (%s)','Knowledge base search'=>'Utafutaji wa maarifa','Placeholder text'=>'Matini ya kishikilia nafasi','Search only this category (slug or ID)'=>'Tafuta katika kategoria hii pekee (slug au ID)','Show results while typing (%s)'=>'Onyesha matokeo wakati wa kuandika (%s)','Knowledge base categories'=>'Jamii za msingi wa maarifa','Only these categories (slugs or IDs)'=>'Kategoria hizi pekee (slugs au ID)','Sub-categories of (slug or ID; empty: top level)'=>'Vijamii vya (slug au ID; tupu: kiwango cha juu)','Articles under each category'=>'Makala chini ya kila kategoria','Show descriptions (%s)'=>'Onyesha maelezo (%s)','Order: order, name or count'=>'Agizo: agizo, jina au idadi','Hide empty categories (%s)'=>'Ficha kategoria tupu (%s)','Knowledge base category'=>'Kategoria ya msingi wa maarifa','Category (slug or ID; empty: the category being viewed)'=>'Kitengo (slug au ID; tupu: kitengo kinachotazamwa)','Heading (empty: the category name)'=>'Kichwa cha habari (tupu: jina la kategoria)','How many articles (empty: all)'=>'Makala ngapi (tupu: zote)','Order: order, title, date, modified or helpful'=>'Agizo: agizo, kichwa cha habari, tarehe, iliyorekebishwa au yenye msaada','Show summaries (%s)'=>'Onyesha mihtasari (%s)','Show sub-categories (%s)'=>'Onyesha kategoria ndogo (%s)','Knowledge base articles'=>'Makala za msingi wa maarifa','From this category (slug or ID)'=>'Kutoka kwa kategoria hii (slug au ID)','These articles (IDs, in this order)'=>'Makala haya (vitambulisho, kwa mpangilio huu)','How many'=>'Ngapi','Order: date, modified, title, order or helpful'=>'Mpangilio: tarehe, iliyorekebishwa, kichwa, agizo au yenye kusaidia','Layout: list or grid'=>'Mpangilio: orodha au gridi','Grid columns, 1 to 4'=>'Safu wima za gridi, 1 hadi 4','Knowledge base article'=>'Makala ya msingi wa maarifa','Article ID or slug'=>'Kitambulisho cha makala au slug','Show the title (%s)'=>'Onyesha kichwa (%s)','Knowledge base breadcrumbs'=>'Vifungo vya msingi wa maarifa','No articles match.'=>'Hakuna makala yanayolingana.','See all results'=>'Ona matokeo yote','Search the help centre…'=>'Tafuta kwenye kituo cha msaada...','Search'=>'Tafuta','No categories yet.'=>'Hakuna kategoria bado.','%d article'=>'makala %d' . "\0" . '%d ya makala','All %d articles'=>'Makala yote %d','No articles in this category yet.'=>'Hakuna makala bado katika kategoria hii.','No articles yet.'=>'Hakuna makala bado.','Breadcrumb'=>'Kijipicha cha urambazaji','Related articles'=>'Makala zinazohusiana','Help centre'=>'Kituo cha usaidizi','Knowledge base'=>'Msingi wa maarifa','Use the knowledge base'=>'Tumia msingi wa maarifa','Articles and categories under Zinn® Chat, Knowledge base.'=>'Makala na kategoria chini ya Zinn® Chat, Msingi wa Maarifa.','The KB lives at your site address followed by this, for example /kb/ or /help/.'=>'Makala za msingi zinapatikana kwenye anwani ya tovuti yako ikifuatiwa na hii, kwa mfano /kb/ au /help/.','Title of the KB home page'=>'Kichwa cha ukurasa wa nyumbani wa KB','Layout of the KB home and category pages'=>'Mpangilio wa kurasa za nyumbani na kategoria za KB','Zinn® Chat layout: search, category cards and article lists'=>'Mpangilio wa Zinn® Chat: utafutaji, kadi za kategoria na orodha za makala','Your theme\'s archive pages'=>'Kurasa za kumbukumbu za mandhari yako','Category columns'=>'Safu za kategoria','Articles listed under each category on the KB home'=>'Makala zilizoorodheshwa chini ya kila kategoria kwenye ukurasa wa nyumbani wa KB','Show how many articles each category has'=>'Onyesha idadi ya makala iliyo nayo kila kategoria','Table of contents on long articles'=>'Orodha ya yaliyomo kwenye makala ndefu','Ask "Was this article helpful?"'=>'Uliza "Je, makala hii ilikuwa na msaada?"','"No" answers appear in the Knowledge gaps report.'=>'Majibu ya "Hapana" yanaonekana katika ripoti ya mapungufu ya Maarifa.','Related articles under each article'=>'Nakala zinazohusiana chini ya kila nakala','Structured data for search engines (Article and breadcrumbs)'=>'Data iliyopangwa kwa ajili ya injini za utafutaji (Makala na njia za urambazaji)','Left to your SEO plugin when Yoast, Rank Math, SEOPress or All in One SEO is active.'=>'Imeachwa kwa programu jalizi yako ya SEO wakati Yoast, Rank Math, SEOPress au All in One SEO imewashwa.','Show "Help articles" search in the chat window'=>'Onyesha utafutaji wa "Makala za usaidizi" kwenye dirisha la gumzo','Suggest related articles under the assistant\'s answers'=>'Pendekeza makala zinazohusiana chini ya majibu ya msaidizi','Write richer articles with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Andika makala zenye mvuto zaidi ukitumia Page Builder Sandwich','Tabs, accordions, callouts and step lists right in the block editor. Every KB article and category page can use them.'=>'Tabu, kodi, visandizi na orodha za hatua moja kwa moja kwenye kihariri cha bloku. Kila nakala ya msingi wa maarifa na ukurasa wa kategoria vinaweza kuvitumia.','Publish your KB in every language with Tranzly'=>'Chapisha KB yako katika kila lugha ukitumia Tranzly','Articles, categories, addresses and search results translated automatically, with each language on its own address.'=>'Makala, kategoria, anwani na matokeo ya utafutaji yametafsiriwa kiotomatiki, huku kila lugha ikiwa kwenye anwani yake yenyewe.','KB categories'=>'Vitengo vya KB','KB category'=>'Kategoria ya KB','Add a KB category'=>'Ongeza kategoria ya KB','Edit KB category'=>'Hariri kategoria ya KB','Search KB categories'=>'Tafuta kategoria za KB','Article'=>'Makala','Add article'=>'Ongeza makala','Add a new article'=>'Ongeza makala mpya','Edit article'=>'Hariri makala','New article'=>'Makala mpya','View article'=>'Tazama makala','Search articles'=>'Tafuta makala','No articles in the bin.'=>'Hakuna makala kwenye pipa.','Search, categories and articles.'=>'Tafuta, kategoria na makala.','One category and its articles.'=>'Kategoria moja na makala zake.','Was this article helpful?'=>'Je, makala hii ilikuwa na msaada?','On this page'=>'Kwenye ukurasa huu','Article not helpful: %s'=>'Makala haijasaidia: %s','Help articles'=>'Makala za usaidizi','Search help articles…'=>'Tafuta makala za usaidizi...','Popular articles'=>'Makala maarufu','No articles match. Ask us in the chat instead.'=>'Hakuna makala zinazolingana. Badala yake, tuulize kwenye gumzo.','Browse the help centre'=>'Vinjari kituo cha usaidizi','Back to the chat'=>'Rudi kwenye mazungumzo','A draft is ready. Check it, fill in anything marked [FILL IN], and publish it: the assistant uses it at once.'=>'Rasimu iko tayari. Ikague, jaza chochote kilichotiwa alama [FILL IN], na uichapishe: msaidizi anaitumia mara moja.','Order'=>'Agiza','Lower numbers come first.'=>'Namba ndogo huja kwanza.','Icon'=>'Aikoni','A Dashicons name such as book, cart or admin-users, or one emoji.'=>'Jina la Dashicons kama vile book, cart au admin-users, au emoji moja.','New ticket #%1$d: %2$s (from %3$s)'=>'Tiketi mpya #%1$d: %2$s (kutoka %3$s)','Customer replied on ticket #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Mteja amejibu kwenye tikiti #%1$d: %2$s','A visitor is waiting in chat #%1$d (%2$s)'=>'Mgeni anasubiri kwenye soga #%1$d (%2$s)','Ticket #%1$d missed its first-reply target: %2$s'=>'Tiketi #%1$d imekosa lengo lake la jibu la kwanza: %2$s','Ticket #%1$d missed its resolution target: %2$s'=>'Tiketi #%1$d imekosa lengo lake la utatuzi: %2$s','Team and routing'=>'Timu na uelekezaji','Hours and SLAs'=>'Saa na SLAs','Email replies'=>'Majibu ya barua pepe','Alerts and webhooks'=>'Arifa na webhooks','Proactive messages'=>'Ujumbe amilifu','Branding'=>'Utambulisho wa Chapa','One per line, for example: Sales. Agents are placed in departments on the Team screen.'=>'Moja kwa kila mstari, kwa mfano: Mauzo. Maajenti huwekwa katika idara kwenye skrini ya Timu.','Let customers choose a department on the ticket form'=>'Ruhusu wateja wachague idara kwenye fomu ya tikiti','Assign new tickets'=>'Kabidhi tiketi mpya','Only agents in the ticket\'s department are chosen when it has one.'=>'Mawakala tu walio katika idara ya tikiti ndio huchaguliwa ikiwa ina idara hiyo.','Do not assign (the first agent to reply takes it)'=>'Usigawe (wakala wa kwanza kujibu ndiye anayeichukua)','In turn (round robin)'=>'Kwa zamu (kila mmoja kwa wakati wake)','To the agent with the fewest open tickets'=>'Kwa wakala mwenye tiketi chache zaidi ambazo hazijafungwa','Use business hours'=>'Tumia saa za kazi','Outside these hours "Talk to a person" is not offered, the chat says when you are back, and visitors can leave a message.'=>'Nje ya saa hizi "Ongea na mtu" haitolewi, gumzo linasema wakati umerudi, na wageni wanaweza kuacha ujumbe.','Time zone'=>'Eneo la saa','For example Europe/London. Empty: the site\'s time zone.'=>'Kwa mfano Europe/London. Tupu: eneo la saa la tovuti.','For example 09:00-17:00, or 09:00-12:30, 13:30-17:00. Empty: closed.'=>'Kwa mfano 09:00-17:00, au 09:00-12:30, 13:30-17:00. Tupu: imefungwa.','Closed on these dates'=>'Imefungwa kwa tarehe hizi','One date per line, as YYYY-MM-DD.'=>'Tarehe moja kwa kila mstari, katika mfumo wa YYYY-MM-DD.','Track response and resolution targets (SLAs)'=>'Fuatilia malengo ya majibu na utatuzi (SLAs)','Tickets show how long is left, and the team is alerted when a target is missed.'=>'Tiketi zinaonyesha muda uliobaki, na timu hupewa tahadhari wakati lengo linakosa kufikiwa.','Count only business hours toward the targets'=>'Hesabu saa za kazi pekee kuelekea malengo','Let the AI set the priority of new tickets from their urgency'=>'Wacha AI iweke kipaumiliki cha tiketi mpya kulingana na dharura yake','First reply within (hours), %s'=>'Jibu la kwanza ndani ya (saa), %s','Solved within (hours), %s'=>'Imetatuliwa ndani ya (saa), %s','Customers reply to ticket emails'=>'Wateja wanajibu barua pepe za tiketi','Their reply is added to the ticket, and the team is told.'=>'Jibu lao linaongezwa kwenye tiketi, na timu inaarifiwa.','Off (they reply on the ticket page)'=>'Imezimwa (wanajibu kwenye ukurasa wa tiketi)','Read a mailbox (IMAP)'=>'Soma kisanduku cha barua (IMAP)','An email service forwards messages to this site (webhook)'=>'Huduma ya barua pepe husambaza ujumbe kwenye tovuti hii (webhook)','Support email address'=>'Anwani ya barua pepe ya usaidizi','Replies go to this address. It must be the mailbox read below, or the address your email service forwards.'=>'Majibu huenda kwa anwani hii. Lazima iwe sanduku la barua linalosomwa hapa chini, au anwani ambayo huduma yako ya barua pepe inayosambaza.','Use plus addresses (support+123@…) so each reply finds its ticket'=>'Tumia anwani za ziada (support+123@…) ili kila jibu lipate tiketi yake','Only if your mailbox accepts them; the ticket number in the subject works too.'=>'Ni endapo tu sanduku lako la barua linazipokea; nambari ya tikiti katika mada inafanya kazi pia.','Open a new ticket for other emails to the support address'=>'Fungua tiketi mpya kwa barua pepe zingine kwa anwani ya usaidizi','IMAP server'=>'Seva ya IMAP','For example imap.gmail.com.'=>'Kwa mfano imap.gmail.com.','IMAP port'=>'Bandari ya IMAP','IMAP security'=>'Usalama wa IMAP','IMAP user name'=>'Jina la mtumiaji la IMAP','IMAP password'=>'Nenosiri la IMAP','An app password where your provider offers one.'=>'Nenosiri la programu pale ambapo mtoa huduma wako anatoa moja.','Send alerts for'=>'Tuma arifa kwa','New tickets'=>'Tiketi mpya','Customer replies'=>'Majibu ya wateja','Visitors waiting in chat'=>'Wagenzi wanaosubiri kwenye soga','Missed SLA targets'=>'Malengo ya SLA yaliyokosa','Push notifications to the agents\' phones and computers'=>'Tuma arifa kwa simu na kompyuta za mawakala','Each agent turns them on in the Inbox, on each device.'=>'Kila wakala huviwasha kwenye Kikasha, kwenye kila kifaa.','Slack incoming webhook URL'=>'URL ya webhook inayoingia ya Slack','Microsoft Teams webhook URL'=>'URL ya webhook ya Microsoft Teams','Telegram bot token'=>'Token ya Telegram bot','Telegram chat ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha mazungumzo cha Telegram','Webhook URLs (Zapier, Make, your own)'=>'URL za Webhook (Zapier, Make, zako mwenyewe)','One https:// address per line. Each event is sent as signed JSON.'=>'Anwani moja ya https:// kwa kila mstari. Kila tukio linatumwa kama JSON iliyotiwa saini.','Webhook signing secret'=>'Siri ya utiaji saini wa Webhook','Empty: one is made for you. The X-Zinn-Chat-Signature header carries sha256= and the HMAC of the body.'=>'Tupu: moja imetengenezwa kwa ajili yako. Kichwa cha X-Zinn-Chat-Signature kinabeba sha256= na HMAC ya mwili.','Rules'=>'Sheria','One per line: page | when | message. Page: * for every page, or part of the address such as /pricing. When: a number of seconds, exit (leaving the page) or 50% (scrolled half way). Example: /pricing | 20 | Questions about our plans? We are here.'=>'Moja kwa mstari: ukurasa | wakati | ujumbe. Ukurasa: * kwa kila ukurasa, au sehemu ya anwani kama vile /pricing. Wakati: idadi ya sekunde, exit (kuondoka kwenye ukurasa) au 50% (imetembezwa nusu). Mfano: /pricing | 20 | Maswali kuhusu mipango yetu? Tuko hapa.','Help desk name'=>'Jina la huduma kwa wateja','Shown in wp-admin, on the agent app and on emails in place of Zinn® Chat.'=>'Inaonyeshwa katika wp-admin, kwenye programu ya wakala na kwenye barua pepe badala ya Zinn® Chat.','Logo URL'=>'URL ya Nembo','An https:// image, for emails and the agent app.'=>'Picha ya https://, kwa ajili ya barua pepe na programu ya wakala.','Email footer'=>'Kijachama cha barua pepe','Tone'=>'Mtindo','Friendly'=>'Rafiki','Professional'=>'Kitaalam','Short and to the point'=>'Fupi na kueleweka moja kwa moja','Playful'=>'Ya kucheza','Persona'=>'Persona','Who the assistant is, for example: "Sam, who has worked in our bakery for ten years."'=>'Msaidizi ni nani, kwa mfano: "Sam, ambaye amefanya kazi katika duka letu la mikate kwa miaka kumi."','Hand over to a person when a visitor writes'=>'Mkabidhi mtu wakati mgeni anaandika','Words or phrases, one per line, for example: refund, complaint, cancel my order.'=>'Maneno au vidadisi, moja kwa kila mstari, kwa mfano: kurejeshewa pesa, malalamiko, sitisha agizo langu.','Hand over at once when the assistant cannot answer and someone is online'=>'Kabidhi mara moja wakati msaidizi hawezi kujibu na mtu yuko mtandaoni','Tag, summarise and prioritise new tickets with AI'=>'Weka lebo, fupisha na kuipa kipaumbele tikiti mpya ukitumia AI','Keep a list of the questions the assistant could not answer'=>'Weka orodha ya maswali ambayo msaidizi hakuyajibu','Also read these pages and sitemaps'=>'Soma pia kurasa hizi na ramani za tovuti','One address per line, on this site or another (a help centre, a documentation site). A sitemap adds every page in it. Re-read every day.'=>'Anwani moja kwa kila mstari, kwenye tovuti hii au nyingine (kituo cha usaidizi, tovuti ya nyaraka). Ramani ya tovuti inaongeza kila ukurasa ndani yake. Soma upya kila siku.','Ask customers to rate the help they got when a ticket is solved'=>'Waombe wateja watoe ukadiriaji wa msaada waliopata tiketi inapozimwa','Webhook address for your email service (Postmark, Mailgun, SendGrid, Cloudflare Email Routing, or any service that can post the message as JSON):'=>'Anwani ya Webhook kwa ajili ya huduma yako ya barua pepe (Postmark, Mailgun, SendGrid, Cloudflare Email Routing, au huduma yoyote inayoweza kuchapisha ujumbe kama JSON):','Keep it private: anyone with it could add replies. Save the settings with a new mode to change it.'=>'Weka faragha: mtu yeyote aliye nayo anaweza kuongeza majibu. Hifadhi mipangilio kwa mtindo mpya ili kuibadilisha.','Last check: %1$s. %2$s'=>'Ukaguzi wa mwisho: %1$s. %2$s','Low'=>'Chini','Normal'=>'Kawaida','High'=>'Juu','Urgent'=>'Dharura','Monday'=>'Jumatatu','Tuesday'=>'Jumanne','Wednesday'=>'Jumatano','Thursday'=>'Alhamisi','Friday'=>'Ijumaa','Saturday'=>'Jumamosi','Sunday'=>'Jumapili','Dismiss'=>'Ondoa','Push notifications are not available on this site.'=>'Arifa za kushinikiza hazipatikani kwenye tovuti hii.','%1$d waiting in chat · %2$d open tickets'=>'%1$d wanasubiri kwenye soga · %2$d tiketi zilizofunguka','Answer chats and tickets.'=>'Jibu gumzo na tikiti.','Reports'=>'Ripoti','Show the chat'=>'Onyesha mazungumzo','On every page'=>'Kila ukurasa','Only on the pages below'=>'Kwenye kurasa hapa chini pekee','Everywhere except the pages below'=>'Popote isipokuwa kurasa zifuatazo','Pages (IDs; 0 = the front page)'=>'Kurasa (ID; 0 = ukurasa wa mbele)','Post types'=>'Aina za machapisho','Hide from signed-in users'=>'Ficha kwa watumiaji waliotia sahihi','Cloudflare Turnstile site key'=>'Ufunguo wa tovuti wa Cloudflare Turnstile','Optional bot check on new chats and ticket forms.'=>'Ukaguzi wa hiari wa mtandao kwa soga mpya na fomu za tikiti.','Cloudflare Turnstile secret key'=>'Ufunguo wa siri wa Cloudflare Turnstile','%ds'=>'%ds','%dm'=>'%dm','%dh'=>'%dh','Agent'=>'Wakala','Internal note'=>'Ujumbe wa ndani','With the assistant'=>'Na msaidizi','Waiting for a person'=>'Inasubiri mtu','With an agent'=>'Na wakala','Left a message'=>'Umeacha ujumbe','Away'=>'Haipo','Focus mode'=>'Hali ya umakini','Desktop alerts'=>'Arifa za kompyuta ya mezani','Needs a person'=>'Inahitaji mtu','Choose a chat on the left. You can open several; each keeps its own draft.'=>'Chagua gumzo upande wa kushoto. Unaweza kufungua kadhaa; kila moja hutunza rasimu yake.','A visitor is waiting'=>'Mgeni anasubiri','Chat #%d'=>'Mazungumzo #%d','Nothing here right now.'=>'Hakuna kitu hapa kwa sasa.','Visitor #%d'=>'Mgeni #%d','typing…'=>'inaandika…','waiting %s'=>'inasubiri %s','%d online'=>'%d mtandaoni','Close tab'=>'Funga kichupo','Back to the list'=>'Rudi kwenye orodha','Type a reply… (Enter to send, Shift+Enter for a new line)'=>'Andika jibu… (Bonyeza Enter kutuma, Shift+Enter kwa mstari mpya)','Ticket #%d'=>'Tiketi #%d','Take this chat'=>'Chukua gumzo hili','Back to the assistant'=>'Rudi kwenye msaidizi','Make a ticket'=>'Tengeneza tiketi','The visitor\'s email address'=>'Barua pepe ya mgeni','The visitor is typing…'=>'Mgeni anaandika…','New ticket'=>'Tiketi mpya','Search subject, email or number'=>'Tafuta mada, barua pepe au nambari','Customer'=>'Mteja','Priority'=>'Kipaumbele','Needs attention'=>'Inahitaji uangalifu','All'=>'Zote','No tickets.'=>'Hakuna tikiti.','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Ukurasa %1$d kati ya %2$d','Customer name'=>'Jina la mteja','Customer email'=>'Barua pepe ya mteja','Create ticket'=>'Tengeneza tiketi','All tickets'=>'Tiketi zote','Write a reply…'=>'Andika jibu…','Internal note (the customer does not see it)'=>'Ujumbe wa ndani (mteja hauoni)','then: waiting for customer'=>'kisha: inasubiri mteja','then: solved'=>'kisha: imetatuliwa','then: keep open'=>'kisha: weka wazi','#%1$d %2$s'=>'#%1$d %2$s','by email'=>'kwa barua pepe','internal note'=>'madokezo ya ndani','Channel'=>'Kituo','Nobody'=>'Hakuna','Assigned to'=>'Iliyopangwa kwa','Order #%1$s · %2$s · %3$s'=>'Oda #%1$s · %2$s · %3$s','Delete ticket'=>'Futa tiketi','Delete this ticket and all its messages?'=>'Ufute tiketi hii na jumbe zake zote?','Ask what your visitors ask. You see the answer and every page it found, with how well each matched, when it was last updated, and warnings for pages that look out of date. Fix a page, press Re-read, and ask again.'=>'Uliza kile ambacho wageni wako wanauliza. Unaona jibu na kila ukurasa uliopatikana, ukiwa na kiwango cha ulinganifu wa kila moja, wakati uliposasishwa mwisho, na maonyo kwa kurasa zinazoonekana zimepitwa na wakati. Rekebisha ukurasa, bonyeza Soma tena, kisha uulize tena.','For example: What is your returns policy?'=>'Kwa mfano: Je, sera yako ya kurejesha bidhaa ni ipi?','Ask'=>'Uliza','Not updated for over a year'=>'Haijasasishwa kwa zaidi ya mwaka mmoja','A newer page covers the same subject: %s'=>'Ukurasa mpya zaidi unashughulikia mada hiyo hiyo: %s','Re-read ✓'=>'Soma tena ✓','Asking…'=>'Inasubiri majibu…','Outcome: %1$s · Search: %2$s · Tokens: %3$d in, %4$d out'=>'Matokeo: %1$s · Utafutaji: %2$s · Tokeni: %3$d zilioingia, %4$d zilitoka','by meaning and words'=>'kwa maana na maneno','by words only (no embedding key)'=>'kwa maneno pekee (bila ufunguo wa kupachika)','nothing indexed'=>'hakuna kilichoorodheshwa','The AI is not set up yet or could not answer.'=>'AI bado haijasusanidiwa au haikuweza kujibu.','Sources found (%d)'=>'Vyanzo vimepatikana (%d)','Nothi